# No exceptions (audit v3, OPS-1). `deploy/*.key.json` and `deploy/payout/*.key.json` were
# whitelisted here and tracked in a PUBLIC repository, so chains 8–13 all ran on validator seeds
# and payout spend keys anyone could read. Chain 14's keys are generated off-repo by
# deploy/gen-chain14-keys.sh into $KEYDIR and never enter the tree; deploy/lib/key-guard.sh
# refuses a cut that names a key inside it.
